  text: '☀️ Sunday Morning Portfolio Update ⛏️📈


    My mini portfolio hit a high around $72K this year and is currently sitting at
    $69,203.


    YTD: +21.14% | +$12,077 🟢


    Hard to believe this journey started 4 years ago with just $550.


    My top 5 all-time movers have done some serious heavy lifting:

    $SCHD +$2,066

    $SPMO +$1,434

    $AVUV +$1,392

    $SCHG +$1,219

    $SPYI +$916


    Dividends keep rolling in, the portfolio keeps compounding, and the long-term
    plan keeps doing its job.


    Not at the yearly high, but I definitely can’t complain.


    Keep mining. Keep investing. ⛏️💰


    #DividendInvesting #Investing #PortfolioUpdate'
