- id: '2099218566205850079'
  text: 'This is how I’m positioning my portfolio:


    • ~40% AI & cloud infrastructure

    $NBIS, $IREN, $CRWV, $AMZN, $ORCL


    • ~30% High-conviction, asymmetric opportunities

    $HIMS, $LMND, $SOFI, $GRAB


    • ~20% Undervalued stocks with solid dividends

    $NVO, $NKE, $UNH


    • ~10% Crypto

    $BTC, $ETH


    And always some cash on the sidelines, ready to take advantage of market irrationality.'
